efore:\n\\[ 1.06066 = 1 + r \\]\n\\[ r = 1.06066 - 1 = 0.06066 \\]\n\nConverting this to a percentage and rounding to the nearest hundredth:\n\\[ r \\approx 6.07\\% \\]\n\nThus, the equivalent annual interest rate is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{6.07\\%}\n\\]",
